@startuml
title hw7: сервисы и потоки событий
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 70
actor Клиент as client
rectangle "ingress-nginx (API gateway)\nпроверка токена: auth-url → user-service" as gw
rectangle "user-service\n/register /login /profile" as u
rectangle "billing-service\n/billing/account" as b
rectangle "order-service\n/orders" as o
rectangle "notification-service\n/notifications" as n
queue "Kafka (Strimzi)\nuser.registered · order.created · order.payment" as k
database "PostgreSQL (CNPG)\nusers · billing · orders · notifications" as db

client -down-> gw
gw -down-> u : /register /login /profile
gw -down-> b : /billing
gw -down-> o : /orders
gw -down-> n : /notifications

k -[hidden]right-> db

u -down-> k
o -down-> k
b -down-> k
k -up-> b
k -up-> o
k -up-> n

u -down-> db
b -down-> db
o -down-> db
n -down-> db
legend right
стрелка в Kafka — сервис публикует, из Kafka — слушает
endlegend
@enduml
